{"id":"en-48","title":"Fix Increased Flaming During Laser Processing - X Series","family":"x-series","topic":"guides","read_minutes":1,"source_url":"https://wiki.1laser.com/en/x-series/increased-flaming-during-processing-as-machine-usage-increases","source_updated_at":"2026-03-13T08:50:59.573Z","body_html":"<div><h2 id=\"increased-flaming-during-processing-as-machine-usage-increases-x-series\"> Increased Flaming During Processing as Machine Usage Increases - X Series</h2>\n<h2 id=\"problem-description\"> Problem Description</h2>\n<p>Flaming occurs at the point where the laser exits the nozzle during processing.</p>\n<h2 id=\"cause-solution\"> Cause &amp; Solution</h2>\n<p><strong>Category 1: New or Recently Used Machine Issues</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Causes</th>\n        <th>Symptoms</th>\n        <th>Solutions</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Insufficient Air Assist Flow</td>\n        <td>Flaming, charred edges, and excessive smoke in the cut line.</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Increase the air pressure.</li>\n            <li>Check the air tube for blockages or leaks.</li>\n            <li>Use an external air compressor or air pump.</li>\n            <li>Regularly clean the nozzle and check that air is blowing out.</li>\n            <li>Ensure Air Assist is enabled in the software.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Incorrect Focus</td>\n        <td>Charring, wide cut line, and flaming.</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Use the auto-focus function before starting the job.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Material Flammability</td>\n        <td>Occurs when processing inherently flammable materials (e.g., MDF, bamboo, wood, density board).</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Increase the Air Assist flow.</li>\n            <li>Increase the cutting speed.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Poor Exhaust System Efficiency</td>\n        <td>Excessive smoke generation, or even the appearance of flames. Check the exhaust pipes and fan/blower for clear passage.</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Check the exhaust pipes and fan/blower for clear passage.</li>\n            <li>Connect an external exhaust fan.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</figure>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Category 2: Issues Due to Machine/Component Aging</strong></p>\n<figure>\n  <table>\n    <thead>\n      <tr>\n        <th>Causes</th>\n        <th>Symptoms</th>\n        <th>Solutions</th>\n      </tr>\n    </thead>\n    <tbody>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Exhaust Fan Deterioration</td>\n        <td>Hot smoke cannot be extracted in time, leading to secondary combustion (flare-ups). </td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Clean the fan impeller blades and ducting.</li>\n            <li>Replace the exhaust fan or connect an external exhaust fan.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n      <tr>\n        <td>Air Pump or Compressor Aging</td>\n        <td>Insufficient Air Assist pressure, resulting in flames not being blown away.</td>\n        <td>\n          <ul>\n            <li>Replace the air pump or air compressor.</li>\n          </ul>\n        </td>\n      </tr>\n    </tbody>\n  </table>\n</figure>\n<p> </p>\n<p><strong>Important Reminder:</strong></p>\n<p>If these steps do not resolve the issue, please submit a support ticket on ZOHO: <a href=\"https://zohodesk.1laser.com/portal/en/newticket\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://zohodesk.1laser.com/portal/en/newticket</a>. A technician will then be able to conduct a more in-depth diagnosis and resolve your problem.</p>\n</div>","headings":[{"level":1,"id":"increased-flaming-during-processing-as-machine-usage-increases-x-series","text":"Increased Flaming During Processing as Machine Usage Increases - X Series"},{"level":2,"id":"problem-description","text":"Problem Description"},{"level":2,"id":"cause-solution","text":"Cause & Solution"}],"technical_version":"unknown"}